msgid "Preset engine: sets up the site in one step from a preset file (preset.json) or changes it through approved patches. Organisation profile, plugin settings, global styles, templates, header/footer, pages, menus and media. Preview, apply, undo, migrations, export this site as a preset; approved edits from the Flux AI chat and Flux MCP."
